# Kotlin/Java sources are text, always. Asserting this is not cosmetic: a stray NUL byte in a
# string literal once made BookDetector.kt binary to git AND to grep, so diffs were unreadable
# and searches over it silently returned nothing — which cost a real debugging session.
*.kt     text diff=java
*.java   text diff=java
*.kts    text
*.xml    text
*.md     text
*.json   text
*.pro    text
*.toml   text
